00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:30,820
Safe items otherwise.

171
00:07:30,820 --> 00:07:33,820
They do need a lot of things, but you have to make sure they're safe.

172
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:38,820
Rubies, supported for use only with space and with items to carry

173
00:07:38,820 --> 00:07:40,820
