174
00:07:40,820 --> 00:07:41,820
They are going to need things.

175
00:07:41,820 --> 00:07:44,820
And we're going to need to provide most of that support,

176
00:07:44,820 --> 00:07:46,820
hand under hand, critical.

177
00:07:46,820 --> 00:07:48,820
And pearls, we need to be careful.

178
00:07:48,820 --> 00:07:49,820
We need to go slow.

